# UMRSF-TDDFT single-point excitation energies of butadiene (C4H6).
# BHHLYP / 6-31G* -- energy only.
#
# The single token "umrsf" carries what took four legacy keywords: a UHF
# (the "U") high-spin triplet reference, the unrestricted MRSF response, and
# the singlet target manifold.  Plain MRSF ("mrsf") differs only in using an
# ROHF reference; everything else is identical.
umrsf(nstate=5)/bhhlyp/6-31g*
geom="""
C   -1.901080641    0.114577198    0.000000000
C   -0.574900598   -0.402237631    0.000000000
C    1.901080641   -0.114577198    0.000000000
